- **AppData/Local/Ollama**: LLM model cache (if you're not actively using it)
- **Downloads folder**: Likely has old installers
- **unsloth_compiled_cache**: ML compilation cache—can rebuild

**What I skipped:** Full scan of AppData/Local/* and Windows folder—your disk I/O is slow. If you need exact GB numbers, run `TreeSize` (portable .exe) which is faster on Windows than du.

